# Depends: kvlite, librocksdbX, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
# Description: KVLite RocksDB storage driver (system engine)
#  The RocksDB driver bundle for KVLite, composed with the distro engine:
#  no engine code ships in this package. Any installed kvlite host drives
#  it (install.sh --no-cli-link keeps bin/kvlite single-owned).
